Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:02.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,IN THE PITCH-BLACK NIGHT, KIBO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:04.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,LEANED AGAINST A WARM ROCK TO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.44,0:00:06.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,REST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:08.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,THEN THE ROCK BEGAN TO BREATHE.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:11.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,WHY WERE ANCIENT HUMANS SO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:13.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,TERRIFIED OF THE DARK?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:15.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,TO FIND OUT,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.38,0:00:17.46,Cap,,0,0,0,,WE GO BACK TO KIBO'S AFTERNOON.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,KIBO WAS THE BRAVEST BOY IN HIS
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.17,0:00:21.85,Cap,,0,0,0,,CLAN, AND HE THOUGHT FEAR OF THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.85,0:00:24.61,Cap,,0,0,0,,DARK WAS SILLY. TONIGHT, HE WOULD
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.61,0:00:25.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,PROVE IT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:28.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,WHILE EVERYONE STAYED CLOSE TO THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.09,0:00:30.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,FIRE, KIBO SLIPPED AWAY TO PICK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,BERRIES AS THE SUN WENT DOWN.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,BUT NIGHT FALLS FAST ON THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.24,0:00:38.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,SAVANNAH. WITHIN MINUTES KIBO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.32,0:00:40.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,COULDN'T SEE HIS OWN HANDS.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.60,0:00:43.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,KIBO'S EYES WERE MADE FOR DAYTIME.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.24,0:00:44.80,Cap,,0,0,0,,LEOPARDS SEE PERFECTLY IN THE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.80,0:00:46.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,DARK, AND THEY HUNTED PEOPLE JUST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:47.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,LIKE HIM.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.75,0:00:50.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,KIBO RAN TOWARD THE TINY GLOW OF
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.87,0:00:53.19,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE CAMP FIRE AND THE SHADOWS DID
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:55.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,NOT FOLLOW HIM INTO THE LIGHT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.95,0:00:58.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,THE CHILDREN WHO FEARED THE DARK
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.55,0:01:00.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,STAYED BY THE FIRE AND LIVED TO
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.75,0:01:02.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,BECOME OUR ANCESTORS.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.59,Cap,,0,0,0,,THAT SHIVER YOU FEEL AT NIGHT IS
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.59,0:01:06.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,THEIR GIFT TO YOU.
